{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01218","headline":"相和歌辞 苦寒行 · 刘驾","name":"相和歌辞 苦寒行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"严寒动八荒，莿莿无休时。\n阳乌不自暖，雪压扶桑枝。\n岁暮寒益壮，青春安得归。\n朔雁到南海，越禽何处飞？\n谁言贫士叹，不爲身无衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01218.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01218","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}